{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52089","headline":"五言咏棋（二首） 一 · 太宗皇帝李世民","name":"五言咏棋（二首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"手谈标昔美，坐隐逸前良。\n参差分两势，玄素引双行。\n舍生非假命，带死不关伤。\n方知仙岭侧，烂斧几寒芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝李世民","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}